    {
      "id": "seg:heading:overview:0009:0001",
      "source": "Overview",
      "ko": "Overview",
      "sourceHash": "d4b1ea5708dd532930a85188b45aff6f0a3ed458500c7577e0127a538eb0d100",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0010:0001",
      "source": "To effectively use `AVMetadataItem`, you need to understand how [`AVFoundation`](AVFoundation.md) organizes metadata.",
      "ko": "`AVAudioUnitSampler`의 출력은 단일 스테레오 버스입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "2b60528804827cb2e370b88810c40fbea81470d7bddb4c3e7e562acfb0909672",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0010:0002",
      "source": "To simplify finding and filtering metadata items, the framework groups related metadata into key spaces:",
      "ko": "To simplify finding and filtering metadata items, the framework groups related metadata into key spaces:",
      "sourceHash": "02909558293d37571fe897384e125daee82470030da74011c22ffcf48cc28e37",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:overview:0011:0001",
      "source": "**Format-specific key spaces.** The framework defines several format-specific key spaces. They roughly correlate to a particular container or file format, such as QuickTime (QuickTime metadata and user data) or MP3 (ID3). However, a single asset may contain metadata values across multiple key spaces. To retrieve an asset’s complete collection of format-specific metadata, you use its [`metadata`](avasset/metadata.md) property.",
      "ko": "**Format-specific key spaces.** The framework defines several format-specific key spaces. They roughly correlate to a particular container or file format, such as QuickTime (QuickTime metadata and user data) or MP3 (ID3). However, a single asset may contain metadata values across multiple key spaces. To retrieve an asset’s complete collection of format-specific metadata, you use its [`metadata`](avasset/metadata.md) property.",
      "sourceHash": "b3b5b49576e37fbbf6891bd3e9203ce4e5cdfc2cac03d4d8599b8f64bc23f2b0",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:overview:0011:0002",
      "source": "**Common key space.** There are several common metadata values, such as a movie’s creation date or description, that can exist across multiple key spaces. To help normalize access to this common metadata, the framework provides a common key space that gives access to a limited set of metadata values common to several key spaces. This makes it easy to retrieve commonly used metadata without concern for the specific format. To retrieve an asset’s collection of common metadata, you use its [`commonMetadata`](avasset/commonmetadata.md) property.",
      "ko": "**Common key space.** There are several common metadata values, such as a movie’s creation date or description, that can exist across multiple key spaces. To help normalize access to this common metadata, the framework provides a common key space that gives access to a limited set of metadata values common to several key spaces. This makes it easy to retrieve commonly used metadata without concern for the specific format. To retrieve an asset’s collection of common metadata, you use its [`commonMetadata`](avasset/commonmetadata.md) property.",
      "sourceHash": "1a776759ad5bb00c75358f9a73dd354a799eb163030bcc8535d5022099c3abdf",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0012:0001",
      "source": "Metadata items have keys that accord with the specification of the container format from which they’re drawn.",
      "ko": "Metadata items have keys that accord with the specification of the container format from which they’re drawn.",
      "sourceHash": "b27fc3a646de235686a63b46dcb7e0c87789e130be079f3ec7cc7f6ea9634628",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0012:0002",
      "source": "Full details of the metadata formats, metadata keys, and metadata key spaces supported by AVFoundation are available in [`AVMetadataKeySpace`](avmetadatakeyspace.md) and [`AVMetadataKey`](avmetadatakey.md).",
      "ko": "Full details of the metadata formats, metadata keys, and metadata key spaces supported by AVFoundation are available in [`AVMetadataKeySpace`](avmetadatakeyspace.md) and [`AVMetadataKey`](avmetadatakey.md).",
      "sourceHash": "fda1afd6fe0eba5a214486fd5be51b422ad86361ccb1320df008c7815d213d03",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0013:0001",
      "source": "To load values of a metadata item when you access them for the first time, use the methods from the [`AVAsynchronousKeyValueLoading`](avasynchronouskeyvalueloading.md) protocol.",
      "ko": "To load values of a metadata item when you access them for the first time, use the methods from the [`AVAsynchronousKeyValueLoading`](avasynchronouskeyvalueloading.md) protocol.",
      "sourceHash": "a36d1b4a964ecc521c420b42f73d5742718b66e4798c4ca305bf2243b0eecf54",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0013:0002",
      "source": "The [`AVAsset`](avasset.md) class and other classes in turn provide their metadata as needed so that you can obtain objects from those arrays without incurring overhead for items you don’t inspect.",
      "ko": "The [`AVAsset`](avasset.md) class and other classes in turn provide their metadata as needed so that you can obtain objects from those arrays without incurring overhead for items you don’t inspect.",
      "sourceHash": "586c1876777b44453b85bad909ed3bc99f503427a4b3a6a40e165d25690203e5",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0014:0001",
      "source": "To filter arrays of metadata items, you use the methods of this class.",
      "ko": "To filter arrays of metadata items, you use the methods of this class.",
      "sourceHash": "313c506a0613e51099b66eeee9d4189c4a4e8c0c9f0bac3ebcc71843017b0d83",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0014:0002",
      "source": "For example, you can filter by key and key space, by locale, and by preferred language.",
      "ko": "For example, you can filter by key and key space, by locale, and by preferred language.",
      "sourceHash": "595b3bb0555840347cef5d51bca3c28ce4769b2dbc9f676afb40eba54df0c4a8",
      "status": "failed"
    },
